## Interface: 16001, 120007
## Title: ForeverDB
## Notes: World of Warcraft: Forever database - item sources with drop chances, vendors, quests, NPCs and map spots. Merged from QuestieDB (Forever), VMaNGOS, cMaNGOS and pfQuest, cross-checked, plus in-game recordings. Shared by any addon that wants it (Command Center uses it). Loaded only when an addon asks for it.
